==German==

===Etymology===
{{prefix|de|be|handeln}}. Compare {{cog|stq|behondelje}}, {{cog|nl|behandelen}}, {{cog|en|behandle}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|[bəˈhandl̩n]|[bəˈhandəln]}}
* {{audio|de|De-behandeln.ogg|audio}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb}}

# to [[treat]] (medicinally)
#: {{ux|de|Der Arzt ''behandelte'' mich.|The physician treated me.}}
# to treat (physically, psychologically)
#: {{ux|de|Ich habe dich immer gut ''behandelt''.|I always treated you well.}}
# to [[cover]]
#: {{ux|de|der Reporter ''behandelt'' das Thema.|The reporter is covering the subject.}}

====Conjugation====
{{de-conj}}

